		{
			description: [
				"你在&5远古矿井&r里发现了一张纸条，上面写着将&d生锈的金属&r与&d来自下界的灵魂&r融合以进行精炼。"
				""
				"据说提炼出的金属更坚固、更耐火。不过，提炼过程似乎会&d摧毁大部分用于提炼的金属&r。"
				""
				"&o(完整配方详情见下一页)&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&4配方&r:"
				""
				"{image:imcquests:textures/misc/netherite_scrap.png width:213 height:89 align:center}"
				""
				"- 生锈的废金属、生锈的废金属板，或生锈的铁板"
				"- 有 &325% 的几率&r 获得下界合金废料"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:ancient_debris"
			id: "40EFDBB314A07305"
			invisible: true
			rewards: [{
				exclude_from_claim_all: true
				id: "2838977F62CCF8A7"
				table_id: 7764861743028037075L
				type: "random"
			}]
			subtitle: "远古残骸合成配方"
			tasks: [{
				icon: {
					Count: 1
					id: "minecraft:written_book"
					tag: {
						AntiqueInk: 1b
						author: "Hisakid"
						display: {
							Name: "{\"text\":\"Nether Infused Metal\"}"
						}
						pages: [
							"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"~~~~~~~~~\\n\"},{\"text\":\"During one of the incursions into the Nether, our warriors noticed the §5souls of the damned§r would cling to their §5rusted§r armors, further eroding it.\"}],\"text\":\"§r§4§lNether Infused Metal\\n\"}"
							"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"It would be sturdier and more heat resistant, but also much less malleable.\"}],\"text\":\"We initially thought it was another ploy by the Pigkin until we realized §5whatever metal survived would be further refined.§r \"}"
							"{\"text\":\"Just as we thought this would be the secret needed to turn the tides, our portal was stormed and we were forced to dismantle it with our own hands. Without the Nether's influence, we were unable to produce more of this metal.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"That said, all I hope is that our brothers left beyond the portal had somehow discovered this too. It's their only chance at surviving the overwhelming force of the Pigkins.\"}"
						]
						resolved: 1b
						title: "日志"
					}
				}
				id: "4307AB52834AD4A7"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "ftbfiltersystem:smart_filter"
					tag: {
						"ftbfiltersystem:filter": "nbt(fuzzy:{author:\"Hisakid\",display:{Name:'{\"text\":\"Nether Infused Metal\"}'}})"
					}
				}
				match_nbt: true
				title: "下界浸透金属"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 8.91d
			y: 3.43d
		}
		{
