							"{\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"~~~~~~~~~\\n\"},{\"text\":\"To our glorious leader. We hope this note has reached your Manor safely.\\n\"}],\"text\":\"§r§4§lPer Your Orders\\n\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"We've finally done it. You will be very, very pleased with these results. Our research into §5enhancing the regenerative properties of the golden apples and our Totems has been successful.§r\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"All that needs to be done in to §5mix a Golden Apple or a Totem with extremely concentrated EXP and two Hallowed Gems in a heated basin.§r\"}"
